            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Remember that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 4 \\times 10]</span> means &quot;<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 4]</span> groups of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 10.]</span>&quot; Therefore, </p>",
            "readable_text": "Remember that [MATH: 4 \\times 10] means \"[MATH: 4] groups of [MATH: 10.]\" Therefore,",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 4 \u00d7 10|=; 10 + 10 + 10 + 10_(\u23df)_(4times)|=; 4tens + 0ones|=; 40|.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 4 \u00d7 10|=; 10 + 10 + 10 + 10_(\u23df)_(4times)|=; 4tens + 0ones|=; 40|.]",
